1
00:00:00,848 --> 00:00:03,888
(Amy:)Very much like this one.
Mm.

2
00:00:03,885 --> 00:00:05,615
(Dave:)I doubt it was
like this one.

3
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:08,350
(Dave:)I mean, he's a genius, and
I wasn't even smart enough

4
00:00:08,356 --> 00:00:11,926
(Dave:)to figure out why my wife
always smelled of croissants.

5
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:14,557
(Amy:)What was the rest
of your question?

6
00:00:14,563 --> 00:00:15,743
(Dave:)Do you think you could
introduce me to him?

7
00:00:15,762 --> 00:00:17,132
(Amy:)Really?

8
00:00:17,132 --> 00:00:19,932
(Amy:)You-you want me to introduce you
to my ex-boyfriend?

9
00:00:19,935 --> 00:00:21,865
(Dave:)You're right,
it's-it's weird.

10
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:23,800
(Dave:)No, wait. Do it.

11
00:00:25,272 --> 00:00:26,702
(Dave:)No. I changed my mind.

12
00:00:26,708 --> 00:00:28,508
(Dave:)I'd be too nervous.

13
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:31,080
Oh! I don't know
what to do.

14
00:00:32,079 --> 00:00:33,409
(Leonard:)Are we gonna be much longer?

15
00:00:33,415 --> 00:00:35,445
(Leonard:)I really have
to go to the bathroom.

16
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:37,650
(Bernadette:)Right here.

17
00:00:40,521 --> 00:00:44,391
(Raj:)37 minutes left
until the deadline.

18
00:00:44,392 --> 00:00:46,592
(Sheldon:)Someone will show.

19
00:00:46,595 --> 00:00:49,965
(Howard:)And no matter what happens,
this is still a fun experiment.

20
00:00:49,965 --> 00:00:53,535
(Raj:)Not as fun as the night we
blew up grapes in the microwave.

21
00:00:54,268 --> 00:00:56,838
(Raj:)We really have led full lives.

22
00:00:57,671 --> 00:00:58,971
(Sheldon:)Someone will show.

